By version: v4 $40.61M, v3 $34.91M, v2 $1.97M. TVL is $3.38B (DL, 2026-11-10): Ethereum $2.19B, Base $0.43B, Robinhood Chain $0.23B, Arbitrum $0.16B; Unichain only $20.4M.

- Market share: 30-day volume $63.24B against $250.9B for all DL "DEX" adapters (25.2%), or against $228.3B excluding prediction-market adapters (27.7%).

- Monthly Uniswap volume (DL, all chains): Oct 2025 $123.6B; Dec 2025 $56.0B; Mar–May 2026 about $40B per month; Sep 2026 $92.1B; Oct 2026 $67.9B.

- Key integrations / partners: Robinhood (Uniswap is the primary public AMM on Robinhood Chain, live since 2026-07-02 per the [Uniswap blog](https://blog.uniswap.org/latest-updates/page/2); TJAR user), Circle (Arc), Coinbase/Base, Spark ($150M stablecoin liquidity moved to v4, 2026-06-25), Securitize/BlackRock BUIDL, Morpho (Earn), Elysium (DefiLlama chain label "Elysium Kinetiq"; described by CoinMarketCap as an L2 settling to HyperEVM; v2/v3/v4 live at its 2026-11-09 mainnet), MegaETH, Monad, Tempo, X Layer.

