### The protocol/business

PancakeSwap launched in September 2020 (anniversary celebrated 22 Sep) on Binance Smart Chain as a fork-style AMM with farms. It is now a multichain DEX "super-app": spot AMM, aggregator/RFQ, perps, prediction, lottery, launchpad, tokenized stocks and pre-IPO access. The user base is mostly retail on BNB Chain, and a large share reaches it through Binance Wallet. This is my inference from the integrations listed below and the ~94% BSC fee share. Community activity centres on Asia: the Kitchen ran booths and events at KBW 2026 in Seoul and is attending Binance Blockchain Week in Bangkok. The docs are published in 11 languages (EN, ZH, ES, FR, IT, JA, PT-BR, RU, TR, VI, KO). No official country-level user breakdown exists. Official cumulative stats (Sep 2026): $4.4T+ traded, 203M+ users, 11 chains ([Kitchen Report Sep 2026](https://blog.pancakeswap.finance/articles/kitchen-report-september-2026)). 2025 official stats: $2.36T volume, 35.37M unique traders, 2.2M CAKE holders.

