#### 4. Revenue to sAERO from a specific pool

# Pool state: fee() 0xddca3f43, unstakedFee() 0xb64cc67b, stakedLiquidity() 0x3ab04b20, liquidity() 0x1a686502, gaugeFees() 0x293833ba# Fee sweeps to sAERO (CollectFees topic):curl -s -X POST https://base-rpc.publicnode.com -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \ -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_getLogs","params":[{"address":"0x4a7af46bc8abc00048c6c7920a1488daf568366c", "topics":["0x205860e66845f2bbc0966bfab80db9bf93fca93862ea2b9fcf6945748352b4a3"],"fromBlock":"0x3513000","toBlock":"latest"}]}'# topics[1] = recipient (the pool's sAERO rewards contract 0x623de2a4...fef48)# data = amount0 (WETH, 18 dp) | amount1 (USDC, 6 dp). Our 24h result: 1.0778 WETH + 1,594.37 USDC (~$3.8k).# FC re-run, 24h to block 55,679,336 (~16:00 UTC): 17 CollectFees = 2.1682 WETH + 2,283.10 USDC; 2,778 Swaps, USDC-leg volume $8.46M# Swap topic for volume: 0xc42079f94a6350d7e6235f29174924f928cc2ac818eb64fed8004e115fbcca67 (24h: $7.70M); volume = sum |amount1| (USDC leg, 3rd data word)# Set fromBlock to a recent block, e.g. (latest - 9000) in hex; keep ranges to ~10,000 blocks per call for reliability. Base ~43,200 blocks/day.# Enumerate Base CL pools: CLFactory 0x9CB220581b91b0C83223012FE69688b92aD07a76 allPoolsLength() / allPools(uint256) (608 pools)

