Contract ABIs are available without a key from Sourcify (e.g. https://sourcify.dev/server/v2/contract/8453/0x59268A34ba897e82368feE39839FFC661D4f9C97?fields=abi). Etherscan V2's free tier does not cover Base (re-confirmed 2026-11-10: "Free API access is not supported for this chain"). The official Aero dashboard data is Dune-sourced ([aero.xyz/economics/metrics](https://aero.xyz/economics/metrics/)). Note that it currently shows an obviously erroneous "Cumulative Fees: $68.87T".

