| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |

| (a) Gross user fees, DefiLlama "UserFees" (swap + liquidity fees + crvUSD/Llamalend interest; excl. bribes) | $69.0k | $1.91M | $4.99M | $52.5M (365d) | DefiLlama dataType=dailyUserFees [3] |

| (a') DefiLlama "Fees" (UserFees + vote incentives) | $266.9k | $2.30M | $6.59M | $58.8M | DefiLlama dailyFees [3] |

| (a'') Curve's own DEX trading fees (10 chains, excl. YB) | Ethereum: $52.8k (rolling, 15:44 UTC) | $499.4k (week to Nov 5) | Aug 2026: $3.04M (month) | not published | Curve API / reports [5][6][7] |

| (b) Protocol revenue, DefiLlama "Revenue" (admin share + bribes) | $200.3k | $1.05M | $2.93M | $26.3M | DefiLlama dailyRevenue [3] |

