- Emission and unlocks: there is no inflation. The 2020 release post allocated 30% to community incentives and 14.5% to the protocol growth and development fund, both unlocked over 4 years from Dec 2020. Investor and team StepVesting contracts started on 2020-12-01 with a 1-year cliff and 3 half-year steps. The two largest (0x1C30…7905 and 0x07eb…20b4, on-chain reads 2026-11-10) finished vesting on 2023-06-02 and each still holds 18.75M of vested but unclaimed 1INCH (receiver 0x4942b2…dfD0). The 2020 investor/team schedules are complete, but smaller vesting is still running. I read all 22 StepVesting contracts among the top 300 holders: about 19.2M 1INCH (1.3% of supply) is still unvested in about 12 newer contracts (start dates 2023-04 to 2026-03, 6-month steps, last ending 2031-03-01; recipients and purposes are not publicly labeled, most likely contributor or grant allocations). Next steps: about 0.04M on 2026-11-19, about 0.40M on 2026-11-30, about 1.03M on 2026-12-01, 0.30M on 2026-12-31 (on-chain started/cliffDuration/stepDuration/numOfSteps/stepAmount reads; the list may miss contracts outside the top 300 holders). These are small against daily volume. The gap of about 94M between circulating and total supply is vested-but-unclaimed, still-vesting or treasury-type balances.

