    ('0x:ZRX', 'https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XE5AK5b4CJNIvbHKyVaSO4o1lZ3zwhrJnlnWQeCa7bg/edit', $tank_seed_ZRX_20261110$## ZRX — 0x: token & protocol fact sheet

As of 2026-11-10

### Executive summary

ZRX is the fixed-supply (1,000,000,000) ERC-20 governance token of 0x. The 0x stack is a DEX-aggregation and settlement layer (Swap API, Cross-Chain API, Gasless API, Settler contracts) built by the private company 0x Labs (ZeroEx Holdings, Inc.), which also runs the Matcha trading app. The business is real and growing in share. On DefiLlama, 0x Aggregator routed $6.02B in the 30 days to 2026-11-09, 9.4% of all tracked aggregator volume and #3 overall. Its customers include Coinbase (DEX trading and Base App), MetaMask, Phantom and Robinhood. Nothing reaches ZRX holders today, though. The on-chain protocol fee multiplier on the 0x v4 Exchange Proxy reads 0, staking has paid nothing since the 2021 "zero-fee experiment", there is no buyback or burn, and monetisation (a 0.15% API fee on select pairs plus subscription plans) flows to 0x Labs equity, not to the token. The token is in a weak state. Its price is $0.0865 (CoinGecko, 2026-11-10 15:47 UTC), down 59.0% over 1 year and 96.5% below its 2018 all-time high. Its on-chain treasury governance has been dormant since June 2024, the community forum is openly hostile ("abandoned"), and it has lost exchange pairs at Bitfinex (full delisting 2025-11-27), Binance (ZRX/BTC and margin, December 2025) and Phemex (2026-09-11). The single thing to watch: any formal 0x Labs or ZEIP proposal that links API or Matcha revenue to ZRX (fee switch, buyback, staking revival). Without one, ZRX is a governance-only token over a treasury of about 6M ZRX.

### What the token is

- Ticker / name: ZRX / "0x Protocol Token" (on-chain name()), 18 decimals.

- Canonical chain and contract: Ethereum mainnet 0xE41d2489571d322189246DaFA5ebDE1F4699F498. Verified by on-chain name(), decimals() and totalSupply() calls at block 26,385,243 (2026-11-10 14:55 UTC), and it matches the CoinGecko platform entry [2]. Bridged ZRX on Polygon PoS (0x5559edb74751a0ede9dea4dc23aee72cca6be3d5) has only 21,938 ZRX of supply (on-chain read, 2026-11-10), so it is negligible. Treat Ethereum as the only relevant venue.

- Launch: token sale on 2017-08-15/16, which raised about $24M in ETH for 50% of supply. The cap was hit in under 24 hours [21][22].

- Initial allocation: 50% token sale, 15% retained by 0x (future hires and running costs), 15% developer fund, 10% founding team (4-year vesting, 1-year cliff), 10% advisors and early backers [21][22]. All vesting schedules ended by around 2021. No scheduled unlocks remain and there is no emission, inflation or mint function.

