### Verification notes

Independent fact-check performed on 2026-11-10 (14:55–15:55 UTC, Ethereum block ~26,385,500).

#### Re-checked and confirmed

- Token contract 0xE41d…F498: name() = "0x Protocol Token", decimals() = 18, totalSupply() = 1,000,000,000 (public RPC); CoinGecko platform entry matches. Polygon bridged supply 21,938 ZRX.

- Balances via balanceOf: Ext Dev Pool 98,350,939.72; Team Vesting 53,252,497.37; ZrxVault 48,729,284.43; ZrxTreasury 6,062,555.07 ZRX and 0 ETH. The derived circulating supply 848,396,562.91 equals CoinGecko's figure exactly.

- Ext Dev Pool: required() = 2, getOwners() = 4 owners. It was funded with 148,946,625 ZRX on 2017-08-15, and its last outflow was 2.0M ZRX on 2021-12-13. Team Vesting's last withdrawal was 0.9005M ZRX on 2024-09-10 (Etherscan V2 tokentx).

- ZrxTreasury: proposalCount = 15, votingPeriod = 259,200 s, proposalThreshold = 1e23, quorumThreshold = 1e25. Creation date 2021-04-16 is correct. Event-topic mapping is confirmed from the verified ABI: 15 created (last 2024-06-04), 10 executed (last 2023-12-24), 208 votes (last 2024-06-16).

- Readings that match the document: v4 Exchange Proxy getProtocolFeeMultiplier() = 0; Settler registry ownerOf(2/3/4) and owner(); AllowanceHolder has code; wZRX totalSupply = 1,061.8 (created 2023-04-06); Staking Proxy epoch 340, 604,800 s.

- The fee-skim example tx 0x67c67b4d…f9f2 is real. The Settler received 542.959 USDC and sent 0.2689 USDC to 0xad01c20d… and 5.158 USDC to 0x5aafc1f2…. The attribution of 0xad01… to 0x Labs is still unverified.

- DefiLlama: 0x aggregator volume 24h, 7d, 30d, 1y and all-time match exactly, as do the monthly series and the chain breakdown. Fees, revenue and holders-revenue endpoints for 0x-aggregator and 0x return "not found". Matcha 7d, 30d, 1y and all-time match.

- Pricing page: 0.15% fee on EVM, Standard $1000, Enterprise $2500. Homepage stats: $200B+, 211M+, 14M+, 500+, 370+ sources, 17+ chains, 4.4% revert rate, SOC2.

- Every 0x blog post date in the news section is confirmed against 0x.org/post: Elysium (chain ID 99901, $6.5B+ on Robinhood Chain), Lightning (80 ms), Centrifuge, Solana transaction v1, Arc, the Uniswap v4 hooks post, Ondo, Solana open beta (zero introductory fees, Kamino and Titan), Solana monetisation controls. "2025 Revisited" confirms the Coinbase "one of only two partners" claim, the Base App, Farcaster, Zora, Flood and the >40% headcount growth.

- Forum threads 1081, 3906, 3995, 4056 and 4092: dates and quotes confirmed. The 2026-10-21 post is hidden. The SwapNet details ($13.43M, 20 users, 0x contracts not affected) are confirmed by The Block and DL News.

