- Market data refreshed to 15:47 UTC: price $0.0865, market cap $73.4M, FDV $86.5M, rank #326, 30d −33.1%, 1y −59.0%, OI, ticker shares. Holders updated to 198,657. DefiLlama's all-aggregator totals were revised, so 0x's 24h share changes from 11.1% to 10.7%. Matcha 24h is now $1,133. Uniswap Aggregator 1y volume ($16.3B) and CoW/1inch revenue were added.

- Quote attribution: the "early 2022" economics promise came from the DAO update (nikita, 2021-12-17), not from Will Warren. Warren wrote "we must nail the economics". Also added the 2022 0x Labs staff statement that ZRX "has always been a governance token" and that a revived staking system would earn little.

- Leadership: the claim that Warren cited "the co-CEO structure slowing decisions" and the "organisational restructuring" were not supported by any reachable source. They are replaced with what The Defiant and CoinStats report ("personal decision", stays on the board). Bandeali being "sole CEO" is now marked as an inference.

- Delistings: the u.today source supports only the Binance ZRX/BTC margin removal (2025-12-04). The spot pair's "BREAK" status was confirmed via the Binance API, and the 2025-12-12 spot date is marked as unverified. The Bitfinex delisting date (2025-11-27) is now included.

- Cross-Chain API: the unverified "20+ chains" and "private beta 2026-02-25" were removed. Fixed a broken sentence in Key people and adjusted the volume-trend statement (October fell back from the September record).

#### Remains unverified

- No official 0x Labs announcement of the May 2026 leadership change was found. The primary Defiant article body was not accessible.

- Phemex delisting (2026-09-11), the x402 launch (2026-06-23) and the Cross-Chain API GA (2026-06-04) rely on secondary summaries (CMC AI / The Defiant).

- The identity of the 149.2M and 30.5M unlabeled holders, and whether fee-recipient 0xad01c20d… belongs to 0x Labs.

- 0x Labs revenue is private and not disclosed. There is no second independent source for gross 0x API fees beyond the arithmetic ceiling, because no DefiLlama, Token Terminal or Dune series exists for it.

- The web-search budget was exhausted mid-check, so no further news cross-searches were possible. All news items were checked by opening the cited links directly.
